| {name} | {path} | {file} | {purpose} |

## Dependencies
**Allowed:**
- {source} → {target}: {reason}

**Prohibited:**
- {source} → {target}: use {interface} instead

## Patterns Copilot Will Use
- {pattern}: found in {file}
- {pattern}: found in {file}

## Anti-patterns Copilot Must Avoid
- Never {prohibition 1}
- Never {prohibition 2}

## Key Files for Each Module
```
{source_tree_with_important_files}
